53
00:02:03,022 --> 00:02:04,515
and digital objecthood,

54
00:02:04,649 --> 00:02:07,102
between value discrepancy and speculation,

55
00:02:07,182 --> 00:02:08,332
that CENTS resides.

56
00:02:09,822 --> 00:02:13,021
Cent #1264, a great Cent.
